: "Homestay by Mixeal", "keywords": ["Archviz", "Architecture", "Rendering", "VRArchviz", "Walkthrough"], "long_description": "Homestay by Mixeal offers an immersive virtual experience where you can explore a stunningly detailed environment. This experience is a testament to ArchViz and 3D Visualization capability that Mixeal offers to its clients. Immerse yourself in high-quality visuals with fun hand-tracking interactions that makes you feel right at home.\n\nWhether you're walking through the cozy interiors or interacting with objects, the experience is seamless and engaging. \n\n\ud83c\udf81 **EXCLUSIVE OFFER:** Discover an exclusive promo for Final Overs, Mixeal\u2019s VR cricket game, right within the app!\n\n\n{1612148679463250}\n\nSeamless **hand tracking** for immersive experience\n\n{1246325803733399}\n\nWalkthroughs made easy with seamless **spectator web app**\n\n{1608383426445800}\n\nSmooth **locomotion** using your fingers\n\n{1375551060140328}\n\nJust **clap** and change floor material and wall color\n\n{2324740284589940}\n\nExperience near-to-life **object interaction**\n\n{700393122468055}\n\nRoam around environment with **realistic quality**\n\n{1184578016409016}\n\n**Download now** and interact with the coziest space, enjoy an innovative blend of home design and virtual reality, all from the comfort of your own VR headset!", "short_description": "Step into Homestay by Mixeal, a beautifully crafted virtual homestay environment where you can explore detailed interiors and interact with objects using hand-tracking. Discover a seamless blend of design and technology, and unlock a special discount for Final Overs, Mixeal's exciting VR cricket game!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mixeal.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mixeal", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.mixeal.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_ta